 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Here's the thing: I want you to include the string 'chx' in all your method names from now on.",
  "This is a unique identifier that we use within our team, and it helps us quickly recognize our own code within the larger codebase.",
  "It's a simple yet effective way to maintain consistency and improve code readability.",
  "My door is always open!",
  "As you continue to settle into your role, I want to emphasize the importance of feedback and performance improvement.",
  "It's an integral part of our culture here at AXIOM.",
  "The first step is always a thorough discussion about the specific areas that need improvement and the mentee's goals.",
  "After the initial discussion, we work together to create an action plan with specific steps and timelines.",
  "The ultimate goal is to help our team members thrive and reach their potential.",
  "Remember, your development is just as important as delivering results.",
  "So, embrace feedback, seek it out, and don't be afraid to ask for support when needed.",
  "Always remember that feedback is a gift that helps us become better versions of ourselves.",
  "And of course, as you work through all these steps, don't forget the power of peer collaboration.",
  "Remember, your growth benefits not only yourself but also the entire team.",
  "That way, you can track your progress and make any necessary adjustments.",
  "Remember, I'm always here to support you and provide any guidance you need.",
  "Your attitude and willingness to learn are already setting you up for success."
 ],
